<view class="page">
  <view class="my-header">
    <view class="my-title">我的报名</view>
    <view class="muted">下拉刷新报名状态</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="list">
    <view wx:for="{{skeletons}}" wx:key="*this" class="skeleton" />
  </view>

  <view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="error-box">
    <view>{{error}}</view>
    <button class="secondary-btn retry-btn" bindtap="retry">重新加载</button>
  </view>

  <view wx:elif="{{items.length === 0}}" class="empty">
    <view class="empty-icon">📝</view>
    <view class="empty-title">还没有报名记录</view>
    <view class="tiny">去赛事列表看看，选择组别开始报名。</view>
    <button class="primary-btn empty-action" bindtap="goEvents">浏览赛事</button>
  </view>

  <view wx:else class="list">
    <view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="card enrollment-card">
      <view class="row">
        <view class="enrollment-title">报名 {{item.id}}</view>
        <view class="status-pill status-{{item.statusTone}}">{{item.statusText}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="enrollment-meta">
        <view class="meta-line"><text class="meta-label">赛事</text><text class="mono">{{item.event_id}}</text></view>
        <view class="meta-line"><text class="meta-label">组别</text><text class="mono">{{item.group_id}}</text></view>
        <view class="meta-line"><text class="meta-label">报名时间</text><text>{{item.createdText}}</text></view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.order_id}}" class="meta-line"><text class="meta-label">订单</text><text class="mono">{{item.order_id}}</text></view>
      </view>

      <button
        wx:if="{{item.canPay}}"
        class="primary-btn pay-btn"
        data-order-id="{{item.order_id}}"
        loading="{{payingOrderId === item.order_id}}"
        disabled="{{payingOrderId}}"
        bindtap="payPending"
      >继续支付</button>
    </view>

    <view class="notice">
      报名状态以服务端记录为准；支付完成后如状态未更新，请稍后下拉刷新。
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
